{"sourceUrl":"https://ngce.csu.edu.cn/info/1015/1800.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:11.429490+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ngce.csu.edu.cn/info/1015/1800.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>    为促进各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，我院决定举办</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>优秀大学生</span><span><span>暑期招生宣讲开放日活动（以下简称开放日活动），现就开放日活动相关事项通知如下。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、活动宗旨</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>开放日活动旨在搭建学院与学生交流互动平台，活动期间学员有机会了解学院研究生招生政策，聆听知名学者讲座，与相关专业教授进行交流，促进师生之间的相互了解，感受学校良好的教学科研氛围。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>、申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>遵纪守法，品行端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校的</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>届优秀本科生</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>学习成绩优异，综合素质高，有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的研究能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、申请专业</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>089901</span><span>新能源与储能工程、</span><span>0854</span><span>电子信息、</span><span>0856</span><span>材料与化工、</span><span>0857</span><span>资源与环境、</span><span>0858</span><span>能源动力；</span></span><span>0855<span>机械；</span><span>0860</span><span>生物与医药；</span><span>0859</span><span>土木水利；</span><span>0861</span><span>交通运输</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>注：</span><span>2027</span><span>年招生专业以最终公布的招生简章为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、报名时间与方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名时间：</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span>—</span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名方式：线上报名，登录</span><span>“</span><span>中南大学</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日</span><span>”</span><span>网站报名，报名链接：</span><span>https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsglxly/tmsgl/default.aspx</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、资格审查</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>完成网上申请的学生于</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日前提交资格审查材料至电子邮箱</span></span><span><span>gzy</span></span><span>@csu.edu.cn<span>，邮件主题为</span><span>“</span><span>本科学校名称</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>”</span><span>，所有材料按顺序整理成一份</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，文件命名为</span><span>“</span><span>本科学校名称</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>提交资格审查的材料如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>本人身份证和学生证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>网上报名《申请表》一份</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>网上提交申请后下载打印，不需要加盖公章）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>学习成绩单及成绩排名证明（</span></span><span><span>由</span></span><span><span>所在学校或院系教务部门加盖公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>大学英语四级或六级考试成绩单</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>五</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>其他材料：</span></span><span><span>学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）；获得的各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书等</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>其他相关材料。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院预计于</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span>日前完成对报名学生的资格审查，学生可通过报名网站点击</span><span>“</span><span>申请状态查询</span><span>”</span><span>，如状态为</span><span>“</span><span>申请信息院系审核合格</span><span>”</span><span>即为取得报名资格。取得报名资格的学生请在来校参加宣讲开放日活动时带好以上材料原件。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、具体活动安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院预计于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日</span><span>-28</span><span>日期间举办暑期招生宣讲开放日活动，活动时间为一天，具体安排另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>活动内容：</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）开幕式：介绍学院、学科专业、师资力量；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）学术报告会：邀请名师</span></span><span><span>大咖</span></span><span>、企业专家</span><span><span>解读</span></span><span>产业</span><span><span>前沿及成果；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）实验室参观：走进实验室参观学习；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）师生</span></span><span>交流</span><span><span>会：与研究生导师面对面、师兄师姐交流互动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>七、其他说明</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>一</span><span>）</span><span>申请人应提供真实、准确的材料。凡在报名等各环节中弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消参加</span><span>开放日活动</span><span>资格。</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>二</span><span>）</span><span>活动</span><span>期间，请注意保证安全问题，如人身、财产、交通安全等，必须遵守中南大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加各项活动。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>八、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span>胡老师、严老师</span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span>0731-</span><span>888</span><span><span>76326</span></span> </p>\n<p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span></span><span><span>gzy</span></span><span>@csu.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系地址：</span></span><span><span>中南大学岳麓山校区</span></span><span><span>科教楼</span><span>417</span></span><span><span>办公室</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>中南大学</span></span><span>国家卓越工程师学</span><span><span>院</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年研究生招生</span></span><span>咨询</span><span><span>群（</span></span><span>QQ<span>群</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>：</span>1053979664</span> </p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>中</span></span><span>南大学国家卓越工程师学院</span></p>\n<p><span>                                2026年8月4日</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"6dba64badfbc8d6b0aa2f5d8a6ee9d9dc66c49603fb3b00ab098339476484a9d","textLength":1385,"sourceSha256":"08d34877c85c3f51e5ffb1dc261464df1f0c0bcb721f34ff5301df9a99cd3297","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e40155d32c219f78dd9a","title":"2026年中南大学国家卓越工程师学院关于举办2026年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:11.429490+00:00"}
